  "decisions": [
    {
      "item_id": "ade5c65097bf35b3d1cb467e",
      "version_id": "5a82503b8b0e7e873cc96ddaa5b89b9957e647009d50cff4f549b940594dfeef",
      "decision": "accept",
      "reason": "Accept narrowly as a physical-lab contrast, not validated autonomous-science performance. Supplied publication date September 29 falls within the run's 30-day window ending October 13, 2026; retrieval does not establish novelty. Concrete practitioner evidence includes reported furnace instability, telemetry and replicates ([s00303–s00373, 864.38–1005.08s](data/assets/ade5c65097bf35b3d1cb467e/5a82503b8b0e7e873cc96ddaa5b89b9957e647009d50cff4f549b940594dfeef/segments.json#s00303)), and an anecdote about detecting shifted sample labels ([s00890–s00907, 2131.44–2176s](data/assets/ade5c65097bf35b3d1cb467e/5a82503b8b0e7e873cc96ddaa5b89b9957e647009d50cff4f549b940594dfeef/segments.json#s00890)). Editorial inference: these examples motivate logging execution conditions and checking data identity in student experiments. Novelty is the recent account; the incidents themselves are undated. The introduction's thousands-per-day capability framing is not established: the detailed discussion describes that scale as a future objective and allows human handling ([s00746–s00785, 1838.24–1912.74s](data/assets/ade5c65097bf35b3d1cb467e/5a82503b8b0e7e873cc96ddaa5b89b9957e647009d50cff4f549b940594dfeef/segments.json#s00746)). The claimed $30m-to-sub-$1m analysis cost reduction lacks matched accuracy, hardware, workload and accounting evidence ([s01100–s01116, 2613–2652.46s](data/assets/ade5c65097bf35b3d1cb467e/5a82503b8b0e7e873cc96ddaa5b89b9957e647009d50cff4f549b940594dfeef/segments.json#s01100)). No supplied controlled baseline, held-out evaluation, ablation, reproducible artifacts or independent replication validates these gains. Speakers have a direct commercial interest in customer systems and retained IP ([s01206–s01223, 2848.96–2894.64s](data/assets/ade5c65097bf35b3d1cb467e/5a82503b8b0e7e873cc96ddaa5b89b9957e647009d50cff4f549b940594dfeef/segments.json#s01206)); the second founder interview is dependent testimony, not independent researcher corroboration.",
      "piece_ids": ["02", "03"]
    },
    {
      "item_id": "ead4cdfb34d1b428c1cd760b",
      "version_id": "2440cc1580de805fb537ea10d57c87f518177ce7fa5c4cf63e2260a65098b0dc",
      "decision": "accept",
      "reason": "Accept for additional operational detail beyond the first interview. Supplied October 8 publication is in the run's 30-day window; recording and implementation dates remain unspecified. The founders describe replacing impractically slow whole-experiment RL rollouts with characterization tasks rewarding phase identification and penalizing implausible phases ([s00020–s00023, 557–722s](data/assets/ead4cdfb34d1b428c1cd760b/2440cc1580de805fb537ea10d57c87f518177ce7fa5c4cf63e2260a65098b0dc/segments.json#s00020)). They explicitly call full autonomy a non-goal and prioritize automating bottlenecks ([s00230, 3046–3099s](data/assets/ead4cdfb34d1b428c1cd760b/2440cc1580de805fb537ea10d57c87f518177ce7fa5c4cf63e2260a65098b0dc/segments.json#s00230)). Editorial inference: useful guidance for students choosing bounded, measurable delegated tasks. Preserve the correction to the interviewer's claim that observables are unambiguous: founders say multiple phases can fit a pattern and discuss replicates, priors and additional measurements ([s00072–s00082, 1377–1486s](data/assets/ead4cdfb34d1b428c1cd760b/2440cc1580de805fb537ea10d57c87f518177ce7fa5c4cf63e2260a65098b0dc/segments.json#s00072)). Their distinction between failed synthesis under particular conditions and impossibility is also useful ([s00252–s00256, 3373–3406s](data/assets/ead4cdfb34d1b428c1cd760b/2440cc1580de805fb537ea10d57c87f518177ce7fa5c4cf63e2260a65098b0dc/segments.json#s00252)). These are source-described methods, without supplied benchmark baselines, held-out results, ablations, measured budgets or independent replication. The cyclic-label anecdote repeats the first interview and adds no independent confirmation ([s00232, 3100–3171s](data/assets/ead4cdfb34d1b428c1cd760b/2440cc1580de805fb537ea10d57c87f518177ce7fa5c4cf63e2260a65098b0dc/segments.json#s00232)). Commercial customer deployment creates the same founder conflict of interest ([s00341, 4506–4613s](data/assets/ead4cdfb34d1b428c1cd760b/2440cc1580de805fb537ea10d57c87f518177ce7fa5c4cf63e2260a65098b0dc/segments.json#s00341)); independent researcher assessment remains missing.",
      "piece_ids": ["02", "03"]
    },
    {
      "item_id": "youtube-R9momwXV9w4",
      "version_id": "81ddd8b2230f42d36bc234d2235a06343303c4274511e44bb5cd8b1409bafab7",
      "decision": "defer",
      "reason": "Defer the potentially relevant research-evaluation claims because their original supporting evidence is absent. Supplied September 24 publication is within the run's 30-day window, but the video combines purported recent model evidence with older policy history. It reports roughly 56% performance on an internal research benchmark and an 85% substitution threshold ([s00075–s00082, 426.72–471.92s](data/assets/youtube-R9momwXV9w4/81ddd8b2230f42d36bc234d2235a06343303c4274511e44bb5cd8b1409bafab7/segments.json#s00075)), without supplying the original system card, tasks, grading, budgets, hardware, contamination controls or reproducible runs. Its reported absence of sustained twofold acceleration and external evaluator's approximately 30% probability are different statements, not a demonstrated contradiction; the underlying methods and uncertainty cannot be compared here ([s00083–s00098, 471.92–559.52s](data/assets/youtube-R9momwXV9w4/81ddd8b2230f42d36bc234d2235a06343303c4274511e44bb5cd8b1409bafab7/segments.json#s00083)). Preserve its comparison of 2024 commitments with July 2026 changes as an unverified historical comparison, not a new policy event within this window. The embedded researcher discussion raises a relevant evaluation-duration question but is not the complete original interview or evidence of measured long-horizon reliability ([s00200–s00226, 1102.4–1231.52s](data/assets/youtube-R9momwXV9w4/81ddd8b2230f42d36bc234d2235a06343303c4274511e44bb5cd8b1409bafab7/segments.json#s00200)). The narrator promotes an own benchmark, creating an interest in its visibility; financial or vendor ties are not established by the supplied evidence ([s00254, 1374.64–1379.52s](data/assets/youtube-R9momwXV9w4/81ddd8b2230f42d36bc234d2235a06343303c4274511e44bb5cd8b1409bafab7/segments.json#s00254)). Broad forecasts cannot substitute for inspectable experimental evidence.",
      "piece_ids": []
    },
    {
      "item_id": "youtube-wMQB33rM28I",
      "version_id": "91b5117a082251bc859d7cb81ba933c439e1b0450075c2bf98b2b8112bb7d58e",
      "decision": "accept",
      "reason": "Accept as a concrete practitioner experiment-design tutorial, not evidence of achieved improvement. Supplied October 11 publication is within the run's 30-day window. Its contribution is a recent, inspectable proposed protocol; novelty of the underlying optimization method is not established. Correct the title's self-training implication: the speaker explicitly keeps model weights unchanged and varies workflow instructions ([s00010–s00013, 51.34–69.6s](data/assets/youtube-wMQB33rM28I/91b5117a082251bc859d7cb81ba933c439e1b0450075c2bf98b2b8112bb7d58e/segments.json#s00010)). Student relevance is strong: separated worker, optimizer and fixed grader; evaluator checks; and held-out tasks ([s00053–s00074, 257.9–357.26s](data/assets/youtube-wMQB33rM28I/91b5117a082251bc859d7cb81ba933c439e1b0450075c2bf98b2b8112bb7d58e/segments.json#s00053)). The proposed baseline comparison freezes instructions, alternates evaluation order and prevents tuning on final-test feedback ([s00140–s00146, 645.86–674.34s](data/assets/youtube-wMQB33rM28I/91b5117a082251bc859d7cb81ba933c439e1b0450075c2bf98b2b8112bb7d58e/segments.json#s00140)). Its 48-trial accounting includes baseline, candidates and held-out comparisons, with optimizer costs additional; this is a planned workload, not an observed bill ([s00160–s00172, 737.14–798.02s](data/assets/youtube-wMQB33rM28I/91b5117a082251bc859d7cb81ba933c439e1b0450075c2bf98b2b8112bb7d58e/segments.json#s00160)). Actual scores, logs, exact model settings, helper code and linked recording notes are not supplied, so reproducibility and gains remain unverified. Outcomes are explicitly hypothetical and the task set is small ([s00147–s00157, 674.34–726.54s](data/assets/youtube-wMQB33rM28I/91b5117a082251bc859d7cb81ba933c439e1b0450075c2bf98b2b8112bb7d58e/segments.json#s00147)). Preserve the transcript inconsistency: 'Keep rerunning ... until it gets lucky' conflicts with fixed attempt counts immediately around it; do not silently endorse or correct it ([s00103–s00106, 479.06–498.32s](data/assets/youtube-wMQB33rM28I/91b5117a082251bc859d7cb81ba933c439e1b0450075c2bf98b2b8112bb7d58e/segments.json#s00103)). Membership and donation promotion establish a creator monetization interest, not demonstrated vendor sponsorship ([s00194–s00195, 889.18–899.9s](data/assets/youtube-wMQB33rM28I/91b5117a082251bc859d7cb81ba933c439e1b0450075c2bf98b2b8112bb7d58e/segments.json#s00194)).",
      "piece_ids": ["02", "03"]
    }
  ]
}
